       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-ALU.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CLAY-ALU-PROOFS.
           05  WS-MATERIAL-MONISM-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ALU-PARITY-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WINCHESTER-BRIDGE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CLAY-ALU-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CLAY-ALU-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CLAY-ALU-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PCL-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PCL-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MONISM-AND-ALU.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-BRIDGE-AND-LAT.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PCL-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MONISM-AND-ALU.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MATERIAL-MONISM-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ALU-PARITY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-BRIDGE-AND-LAT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WINCHESTER-BRIDGE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CLAY-ALU-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PCL-PROOFS.
           IF WS-MATERIAL-MONISM-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ALU-PARITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-WINCHESTER-BRIDGE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CLAY-ALU-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-CLAY-ALU-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PCL-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PCL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PCL-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PCL-CODE.
